{"id":"tienda","lemma":"tienda","pos":"noun","rank":561,"glosses":["tent","shop, store"],"ipa":"/ˈtjenda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"tiendas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-tienda.wav","examples":[{"text":"¡Ve a la tienda!","en":"Go to the store.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/86735"},{"text":"Fui a muchas tiendas buscando el libro.","en":"I went to many shops to look for the book.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693426"},{"text":"Me gusta esta tienda.","en":"I like this store.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523444"},{"text":"Hay algunas tiendas al lado de mi casa.","en":"There are a few shops next to my house.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689377"},{"text":"Me encanta esta tienda.","en":"I love this store.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443558"}]}